{"id":"a3b65a6dbc3cc9fd","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-residuated-ordinal.md","title":"thm-residuated-ordinal","display":"thm-residuated-ordinal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-godel-ordinal-chain]]","[[93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid]]"],"display":"thm-residuated-ordinal","label":"93-thm-residuated-ordinal","aliases":["93-thm-residuated-ordinal"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4d1699b2d03d166c\" href=\"?note=4d1699b2d03d166c\" title=\"93-df-godel-ordinal-chain\">93-df-godel-ordinal-chain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"666476cf8bc960fb\" href=\"?note=666476cf8bc960fb\" title=\"93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid\">93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-residuated-ordinal"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-residuated-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-residuated-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-residuated-ordinal-thm-residuated-ordinal\">thm-residuated-ordinal <code>thm-residuated-ordinal</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> is the ambient class of ordinals.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\alpha}\">\\(A_{\\alpha}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\otimes_{\\alpha}\">\\(\\otimes_{\\alpha}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha}\">\\(\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha}\\)</span> are the exact constructors of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4d1699b2d03d166c\" href=\"?note=4d1699b2d03d166c\" title=\"93-df-godel-ordinal-chain\">93-df-godel-ordinal-chain</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinResMon}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{LinResMon}_{93}\\)</span> is the predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"666476cf8bc960fb\" href=\"?note=666476cf8bc960fb\" title=\"93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid\">93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}residuated\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n0&lt;\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\n\\mathrm{LinResMon}_{93}\n(A_{\\alpha},\\leq,\\otimes_{\\alpha},\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha},\\alpha)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}residuated\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n0&lt;\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\n\\mathrm{LinResMon}_{93}\n(A_{\\alpha},\\leq,\\otimes_{\\alpha},\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha},\\alpha)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The order on an ordinal alone is not a residuated monoid. The separately defined Gödel-chain operations supply the multiplication, residual, and unit.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-residuated-ordinal-thm-residuated-ordinal","text":"thm-residuated-ordinal `thm-residuated-ordinal`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-godel-ordinal-chain","status":"resolved","id":"4d1699b2d03d166c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-godel-ordinal-chain]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid","status":"resolved","id":"666476cf8bc960fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-godel-ordinal-chain","status":"resolved","id":"4d1699b2d03d166c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A_{\\alpha}$, $\\otimes_{\\alpha}$, and $\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha}$ are the exact constructors of [[93-df-godel-ordinal-chain]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid","status":"resolved","id":"666476cf8bc960fb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinResMon}_{93}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-linearly-ordered-residuated-monoid]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"\\otimes_{\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinResMon}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}residuated\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n0<\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\n\\mathrm{LinResMon}_{93}\n(A_{\\alpha},\\leq,\\otimes_{\\alpha},\\Rightarrow_{\\alpha},\\alpha)","display":true}],"bytes":960,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["4d1699b2d03d166c","666476cf8bc960fb"]}